        "tree_id": "a28d6fe7a2dfde6fd9130c77cf664d4ab85f71d1",
        "message": "Keep the API host out of the shipped Info.plist\n\nThe IPA's Info.plist listed nbtaimlockshopcom.thait2471.workers.dev under ATS\nNSExceptionDomains, so unzipping the bundle handed a patcher the API host. All\nthe entries were inert: the app speaks HTTPS only, and every link (App Store,\nZalo, OTA) is opened by Safari, which ATS does not police. ATS is now the\ndefault deny with no domain list.\n\ncheck_swift_sources.py fails when a Worker or Pages host reappears there, so\nthis cannot come back unnoticed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "timestamp": "2026-11-12T12:17:32Z",
        "author": {
          "name": "thait2471-sys",
          "email": "thait2471@gmail.com"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "thait2471-sys",
          "email": "thait2471@gmail.com"
        }
